From: REPROBE harness hook example
Subject: [PATCH] Emit a REPROBE manifest at the end of each SWE-agent run

Illustrative patch against a SWE-agent-style harness.

Add a single call site at the end of the agent loop so that every
completed run writes a manifest JSON file alongside the trajectory.
This is the smallest useful integration: it does not change the
agent's behavior, only what it records.

The patch is illustrative; line numbers and import paths will need
adjustment against the current upstream tree.
---
 swe_agent/agent.py | 18 ++++++++++++++++++
 swe_agent/reprobe.py | 78 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 96 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 swe_agent/reprobe.py

